      },
      "text": "Analysis of the Spear-Phishing Attack: Intro to RoyalRoad RoyalRoad is a tool that generates weaponized RTF documents that exploit the following vulnerabilities in Microsoft’s Equation Editor: CVE- 2017-11882, CVE-2018-0798 and CVE-2018-0802.",
