        "page": 1,
        "section": "executive_summary",
        "sentence_id": "p1_s2"
      },
      "text": "RoyalRoad is used primarily by threat actors considered to be operating on behalf of Chinese state interests (e.g Tick, Tonto Team, TA428, Goblin Panda, Rancor).",
