        "section": "executive_summary",
        "sentence_id": "p1_s3"
      },
      "text": "RoyalRoad has rather consistent characteristics and most of the weaponized RTF documents usually drop an encoded file named “8.t”, which - once decoded - can deliver a variety of payloads for different threat actors.",
