      },
      "text": "Spear-Phishing Email Delivers RoyalRoad RTF The initial infection vector is a spear-phishing email addressed to the “respectful general director Igor Vladimirovich” at the Rubin Design Bureau, a submarine design center from the “Gidropribor” concern in St.",
