      },
      "text": "cybereason.com /blog/portdoor-new-chinese-apt-backdoor-attack-targets-russian-defense-sector The Cybereason Nocturnus Team has been tracking recent developments in the RoyalRoad weaponizer, also known as the 8.t Dropper/RTF exploit builder .",
